  "body": "Found in the review of PR #3274 (comment 7073329388).\n\n`site/content/guide/operations/operations-2d.md:502` says that the V-Carve Stepdown default is \"the document stepdown\". The app has no such setting. The value comes from `Carried.stepdown`, which defaults to 5 (`crates/app/src/operation/kinds.rs:63`).\n\nExpected: the guide says \"5\", as the other sections do. Also, in `section_lead` (`site/tests/test_guide_icons.py`), refuse a leading catalog block that has no end marker before the next section text, so the search cannot find the end marker of a later block.\n",
